      "blocks": {
        "faq_block_J3hiRY": {
          "type": "faq_block",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I apply the nail strips?",
            "answer": "<p>Here's <a href=\"https://nousnails.com/pages/how-to\" title=\"https://nousnails.com/pages/how-to\">full directions</a> for application. </p><p>1. <strong>Clean nails</strong> with prep pad<br/>2. <strong>Apply nail sticker</strong>, if you're in between sizes opt for a slightly smaller size. Stick, size and slightly stretch to fit.<br/>3. <strong>Smooth out </strong>any air bubbles with the wooden stick provided.<br/>4. <strong>Clip and Buff</strong>. Buff in a gentle downward motion to avoid lifting.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_block_8hf9f6": {
          "type": "faq_block",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long do NOUS nails last?",
            "answer": "<p>With proper application, NOUS nails typically last <strong>up to 14+ days</strong> with salon-quality shine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_block_WCjUXV": {
          "type": "faq_block",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I choose the right nail size?",
            "answer": "<p>Choose the strip that fits your nail <strong>edge to edge</strong> without touching your skin or cuticle. If you're between sizes, always choose the slightly smaller strip.</p><p>✱ Nail Hack: Watch our <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DW5Ti29jVZO/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DW5Ti29jVZO/\">reel </a>here. Warm it up to make it more flexible by rubbing it in the palm of your hands or place it briefly over a warm mug of coffee. Once softened, apply and gently stretch to fit. <em>Note: </em>this only works for slightly smaller strips; overstretching can tear the film or distort the artwork.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_block_j79CCr": {
          "type": "faq_block",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if a strip doesn't fit my nail exactly?",
            "answer": "<p>Our gel strips are slightly stretchable. Gently warm the strip between your fingers and lightly stretch it for a better fit before curing. </p><p>✱ Nail Hack: Watch our <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DW5Ti29jVZO/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DW5Ti29jVZO/\">reel </a>here. Warm it up to make it more flexible by rubbing it in the palm of your hands or place it briefly over a warm mug of coffee. Once softened, apply and gently stretch to fit. <em>Note: </em>this only works for slightly smaller strips; overstretching can tear the film or distort the artwork.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_block_JdF9m9": {
          "type": "faq_block",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why are my nails lifting?",
            "answer": "<p>The most common reasons are:<br/>✱ Oil or lotion left on the nail<br/>✱ Strip touching the skin or cuticle<br/>✱ Air bubbles during application<br/>✱ Not sealing the edges before curing<br/></p><p></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_block_XTwgLF": {
          "type": "faq_block",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use these on extensions?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, you can watch our <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWFsiO4jQJV/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWFsiO4jQJV/\">reel </a>here! If you prefer a longer nail look, you can apply Nous nail strips over clear press-ons or extensions just like you would on natural nails. Be sure the base surface is clean and dry before applying.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_block_3rGCJV": {
          "type": "faq_block",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I use the LED lamp?",
            "answer": "<p>Please ensure the following:<br/>✱ The USB-C cable is fully connected<br/>✱ The lamp is plugged into a power source while using.<br/>✱ Turn on by tapping the top of the lamp. The lamp turns on for 60 sec for each cure.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_block_URhXE3": {
          "type": "faq_block",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use another LED nail lamp?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! Most standard LED nail lamps will cure NOUS gel strips. However, we recommend using the <a href=\"/products/led-gel-lamp\" title=\"LED Gel Lamp\"><strong>NOUS LED Lamp</strong></a> for the curing time and results we designed our system around.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_block_dYbTQj": {
          "type": "faq_block",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the curing lamp harmful?",
            "answer": "<p>No, our curing lamp is not UV. We use LED for curing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_block_EgWMT9": {
          "type": "faq_block",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I cure it in the sun?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! A <strong>10 min sun cure</strong> will suffice if you are walking with bright sun in the daytime.<br/>✱ However, please note depending on sun index availability in your region or season may vary the outcome. </p>"
          }
        }
