            "answer": "<p>Apply <a href=\"/products/ctrl-delete-nail-remover-serum\" title=\"Ctrl+Delete Vitamin Serum Remover\">NOUS Remover Serum</a> around the edges of each nail. Let sit for 30-60 secs. Gently lift the strip using the wooden stick as the serum works underneath. Never force or peel the strips off.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_block_87WbcU": {
          "type": "faq_block",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will these damage my nails?",
            "answer": "<p>No. When applied and removed correctly, NOUS is designed to be a damage-free alternative to traditional gel manicures.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_block_pnpCGV": {
          "type": "faq_block",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I shower or wash dishes?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Once fully cured, your nails are water-resistant and made for everyday wear. We do recommend to avoid taking a bath or applying oils at least 1 hour after application.</p>"
          }
        },
